{"id": "fire-water", "ids": "⿰火水", "title": "Fire-Water", "pronunciation": "huǒshuǐ", "meaning": "The tension between opposing elements held in balance", "etymology": "What happens when fire meets water—not in collision, but in coexistence?\nThis character places 火 (fire) and 水 (water) side by side as equals,\nneither consuming the other. It names the impossible equilibrium: a state\nwhere contradictions don't resolve but simply persist, humming.\n", "components": [{"char": "火", "meaning": "fire", "role": "left"}, {"char": "水", "meaning": "water", "role": "right"}], "examples": [{"text": "他的性格是一种⿰火水，热情与冷静并存。", "translation": "His personality is a kind of fire-water—passion and calm coexisting."}, {"text": "这座城市的⿰火水让人又爱又恨。", "translation": "The fire-water of this city makes you love and hate it at once."}], "tags": ["elements", "paradox", "duality"], "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\">\n<g transform=\"translate(2.10,57.02) scale(0.129016,0.180623) translate(-160.00,795.00) scale(1,-1)\">\n  <path d=\"M 226 483 Q 254 443 285 393 Q 295 375 312 372 Q 324 369 333 381 Q 342 396 342 430 Q 342 472 235 536 Q 220 543 213 543 Q 206 540 204 526 Q 205 513 226 483 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 690 568 Q 677 547 584 441 Q 571 422 592 425 Q 638 449 738 513 Q 762 532 791 543 Q 816 553 805 575 Q 789 597 759 615 Q 731 633 715 629 Q 700 628 704 612 Q 708 590 690 568 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 511 382 Q 520 439 529 618 Q 530 669 548 728 Q 554 741 543 750 Q 521 769 479 785 Q 454 795 434 789 Q 410 779 430 759 Q 464 725 465 690 Q 469 500 448 374 Q 427 209 284 106 Q 244 81 186 49 Q 170 43 167 39 Q 160 32 179 29 Q 197 28 258 48 Q 301 61 365 101 Q 414 131 442 172 Q 484 232 504 341 L 511 382 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 504 341 Q 597 175 715 40 Q 740 9 767 9 Q 843 13 911 17 Q 939 18 940 25 Q 941 32 910 48 Q 753 117 709 157 Q 592 268 511 382 C 493 406 489 367 504 341 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(107.98,38.86) scale(0.161468,0.202811) translate(-99.00,836.00) scale(1,-1)\">\n  <path d=\"M 535 506 Q 538 699 560 762 Q 578 793 520 817 Q 486 836 465 830 Q 447 823 463 799 Q 485 771 486 736 Q 490 697 478 121 Q 477 97 463 88 Q 454 81 432 88 Q 407 94 382 99 Q 348 111 351 100 Q 352 93 373 78 Q 440 24 457 -5 Q 476 -41 493 -42 Q 508 -43 524 -7 Q 543 41 541 117 Q 531 294 534 470 L 535 506 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 154 501 Q 141 501 139 492 Q 138 485 153 477 Q 199 452 227 461 Q 333 489 343 489 Q 359 486 347 456 Q 296 326 249 262 Q 201 190 114 119 Q 99 106 110 103 Q 120 102 141 113 Q 217 153 281 224 Q 342 288 419 454 Q 429 478 441 489 Q 456 501 447 511 Q 437 524 399 537 Q 378 549 336 530 Q 270 509 154 501 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 590 446 Q 630 476 766 584 Q 787 603 814 615 Q 838 627 825 647 Q 809 666 779 681 Q 752 696 738 692 Q 723 691 729 675 Q 735 639 659 553 Q 620 508 577 459 C 557 436 566 428 590 446 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 577 459 Q 555 484 535 506 C 515 528 516 494 534 470 Q 756 161 817 160 Q 898 169 967 175 Q 995 178 996 185 Q 997 192 964 205 Q 810 253 753 295 Q 690 346 590 446 L 577 459 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n</g>\n</svg>"}